WEBVTT

00:09:59.583 --> 00:10:00.851
(Squawk)

00:10:00.875 --> 00:10:03.601
That is the alarm call
by one of those territorial birds,

00:10:03.625 --> 00:10:05.125
and it's coming into frame.

00:10:06.417 --> 00:10:08.750
Pretty soon, its mate is going to join it.

00:10:11.958 --> 00:10:14.726
And so far, this is all very usual.

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:16.184
This is what crows do.

00:10:16.208 --> 00:10:19.167
OK, right now it's getting
a little less usual.

00:10:20.208 --> 00:10:24.851
Not everyone here might be familiar
with what bird sex looks like,

00:10:24.875 --> 00:10:27.500
so if you are not,
this is what it looks like.